<title>UK: Capel Cure Myers in talks with ABN Amro.</title>
<headline>Capel Cure Myers in talks with ABN Amro.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Capel-Cure Myers Capital Management Ltd said on Thursday it was in talks with ABN Amro Hoare Govett which may lead to an offer for Capel Cure Myers.</p>
<p>Capel Cure Myers said it would make another announcement in the near future. It gave no further details.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
